Adaptations for KodaStream: package and import changes; Coil 2.7 image loading
with ImageRequest headers and request sizes; Android string resources instead
of Compose Multiplatform resources; Nuvio's MetaPreview replaced by a HeroItem
mapped from CloudStream SearchResponse and LoadResponse; details enrichment
uses Engine.load; MDBList ratings, the IMDb logo and AppFeaturePolicy removed;
RTL sign handling and status-bar/cutout insets added; Nuvio's vertical-bar
padding helpers replaced by plain horizontal padding from the ported layout.

